outhern Europe and the fourth-most populous European Union (EU) member state. Spanning the majority of the Iberian Peninsula, its territory also includes the Canary Islands, in the Eastern Atlantic Ocean; the Balearic Islands, in the Western Mediterranean Sea; and the autonomous cities of Ceuta and Melilla, in mainland Africa. Peninsular Spain is bordered to the north by France, Andorra, and the Bay of Biscay; to the east and south by the Mediterranean Sea, Gibraltar and Morocco ; and to the west by Portugal and the Atlantic Ocean. Spain's capital and largest city is Madrid; other major urban areas include Barcelona, Valencia, Seville, Málaga, Zaragoza, Bilbao, Murcia, Palma de…","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spain","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"ES"}],"arc":{"reports":25,"first_seen":"2026-10-11T22:00:00Z","first_title":"Eva Steinwald Became Oldest American Woman to Summit Everest After Losing Husband (Exclusive)","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPR25NMUpBUm11X0dDYkNRRVVFbm9sX2ltNWRLNEhVVUJNeEpSWXp6NDFmWjViUWtqd0xqSlJld2lSMXdPc19kMnZRa3NsajVCVUlJNWNXYURZbm53czRnTEVEQU1kaGVVNWFGRjhzYVFNNnNGQzNNSkxRWmFZcFdmcDlSYkJRSzRhOE1wd0k1MUJqOXYtM0o5OWpseGt2dmUzQ3otaVBOVm1jaFlPUE04?oc=5","first_publisher":"People.com","earlier":[{"id":"e_21fa12a686b9","title":"Mexico to Take Part in 30th Ibero-American Summit to Promote Cooperation on Environment, Human Mobility, Education, and Technology","date":"2026-11-04T04:30:27Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5","publisher":"Gob MX","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_870034343e99","title":"Secretary-General Attends Ibero-American Summit in Madrid","date":"2026-11-04T12:00:00Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5lbXBOc19LVHAtaVA5X2RUdzVOb3hocDhUM2owMGR4WXJOOTc0bWk4ajFha1BKUWs2Z0Y5TlYwRTFneThzc0NHTmJCZjNPWThISVJtU2t5Rmh5akJDZTZjTHlB?oc=5","publisher":"UN Media","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_aa0e1e4ea88a"